sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Faculty Member
    actor S as College Student
    participant C as React Client (Browser)
    participant Srv as Express Server
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant St as Supabase Storage
    participant AI as Azure OpenAI & Sapling

    %% Faculty creates assignment
    T->>C: Fill Coursework Details & Questions
    C->>Srv: POST /api/assignments (Bearer JWT)
    Srv->>DB: Insert into assignments table
    Srv-->>C: Return created assignment + Base64 QR Code
    T->>S: Project QR Code in classroom or share public URL

    %% Student submits assignment
    S->>C: Open /submit/:id via URL or scan QR
    C->>Srv: GET /api/submissions/assignment/:id
    Srv->>DB: Select assignment metadata
    Srv-->>C: Render questions, guidelines & deadline
    S->>C: Sign in with Google (verify student email)
    S->>C: Attach PDF/DOCX coursework file & Enter Roll Number
    C->>Srv: POST /api/submissions/:id (multipart/form-data)
    Srv->>St: Upload file to submissions bucket
    Note over Srv,DB: Check if student already submitted (Overwrite rule)
    opt Prior submission exists
        Srv->>St: Delete previous file from storage
    end
    Srv->>AI: Extract text -> Evaluate (gpt-5-mini) + Scan AI % (Sapling)
    AI-->>Srv: Return marks, summary, justification, AI likelihood %
    Srv->>DB: Insert or Update submissions record
    Srv-->>C: Return confirmation & receipt
    C-->>S: Display submission success view

    %% Faculty evaluates & finalizes
    T->>C: Open /assignment/:id
    C->>Srv: GET /api/assignments/:id (Bearer JWT)
    Srv->>DB: Fetch assignment + all student submissions
    Srv-->>C: Render submissions table with AI indicators
    T->>C: Inspect AI Summary modal & adjust/approve marks
    C->>Srv: PATCH /api/submissions/:subId/grade
    Srv->>DB: Update teacher_final_marks & grading_status = TEACHER_APPROVED
    Srv-->>C: Confirm grade update
    T->>C: Click "Export CSV" to download grade sheet
